stateDiagram-v2
    %% A pull request for a branch its caller prepared, or the host's reason
    %% there is none. Called, never mounted on its own: it ends as soon as the
    %% pull request exists, and whatever follows is the caller's.

    [*] --> OPENING
    OPENING --> OPENED: the host has a pull request on the branch
    OPENING --> REFUSED: the host answered that it will not
    OPENED --> [*]
    REFUSED --> [*]
